              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A, ng’om mi babomb, ma ni loka kulo Ethiopia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "m’uoro kwenda ku yor i nam, en e i combo mi mutabi ku wi pi, m’uwacu kumae, Wucidhi, wu jukwenda ma pio, ba thek ma boco ma juruyir ungo, dhanu mi ndiri ugambre i thekri migi cil asu, thek ma juporo ku mukero ma junyono piny de, ma kulo poko ng’ombe mire! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wu dhanu ceke ma wubedo i ng’om, man wun umondo ma wi ng’om, kinde ma juting’o abera malu wi gudi, wunen; man kinde ma jukudho agwara, wuwinji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Yehova wacu ira kumae, Abibedo ling’, man abineno ku i kabedo para, calu lietho m’ulero i derceng’, calu afuru mi thoi i lietho mi mwoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ma fodi mwoka kutundo ngo, kinde ma thiwe thum, man thiwe doko ni nyingulok m’ubecek, ebilwero jange ku pala mi lwer, man jange m’ubeloth ebikabu cen man ebitong’o piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jubiwekogi karacelo ni winyo ma kwiny mi gudi man ni yedi m’i ng’om; e winyo ma kwiny bibedo i wigi i nindo mi lietho, man yedi ceke m’i ng’om bibedo i wigi i nindo mi koyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nindo maeca jubitero giramia ni Yehova mir udul m’uai ba dhanu ma boco man ma juruyime ngo, en e ba dhanu mi ndiri ugambre i thekri migi cil asu, thek ma juporo ku mukero ma junyono piny de, ma ng’ombe kulo poko, jubitero ba ka mi nying’ Yehova mir udul, ba got Sayuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
